# A subSaipen's kitchen is a sandbox, and saiwiki's holds a CLONE of the
# GitHub wiki -- a nested git repository. `git add -A` turns that into a
# gitlink: a 160000 entry pointing at a commit no clone of this repo can
# fetch, with none of the content. It landed in v7.122.0 exactly that way.
.saipen/extensions/subs/*/kitchen/wiki/
